<title>UK: El Al appoints new UK cargo manager.</title>
<headline>El Al appoints new UK cargo manager.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>El Al said it has appointed Gadi Brod as cargo manager for the UK in succession to Jacob Pianko.</p>
<p>Pianko has returned to the airline's head office in Tel Aviv as deputy cargo director and cargo marketing manager.</p>
<p>Brod was previously cargo reservations manager in Tel Aviv. - Reuters Air Cargo Service Tel+ 44 171 542 7706 Fax +5017 - www.racs.com</p>
